ies over the past twelve months to July, up Â£156 on the same period last year - a reminder that even as the rate of inflation cools, the cumulative cost of the weekly shop keeps climbing.</p><p>L&amp;VW agrees that there is an opportunity to enhance the way local government, regulators and Thames Water work together, granting greater public controls on critical business issues to improve delivery of complex, essential infrastructure projects, and demonstrate shared accountability.</p><p>The consortium is willing to make significant new commitments to grant greater controls and oversight to ministers, implemented through a â€˜golden shareâ€™.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/global/live/2026/jul/21/burnham-cuts-vat-electricity-bills-uk-borrowing-debt-economy-news-latest">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;_kazJcf8j3ENbOnAz9DVSiZtiDQGolac83h4PL9QdrUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx9ni:///sha-256;FCnY1s_vw6fZhw1pY27ljUPINernog0ZTlBpcRPsuTwƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;mrv8okcR_15NPudb3f60JUmAXaG3bqmBeJ0rpWaWixQƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;7Z1_CYd4gHdN4HwcLhnXo_KXnx4Qd7QIF7vwj8iOT0Qƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkefalseƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;sZlnPx5qThLRLG2p4-EoXnvrM3pzyFBEUCMcz7j_5RMƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmarkdtrueƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;vRn3fej3fWvUFCTxRt_6AygIUNb7uHNQM8LXJeqmnSQƒdpairƒdleftdstarƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitƒcsumdunitdunit‚dmark`ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Jz0a7xcINbRGq8ozh5mSBjYCzyxSY6LEbckYwhW2OH4ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightduni